A painful dream...

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.360
A dream that I wish to awake from quickly...

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.620
But... how do I know that it's a dream...?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.290
Is it... a dream...?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.700
Really...?

