00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:57.070
The time that meets the new morning
atarashii asa ni deau toki ga ugakidasuyo

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:17.520
Today, due to the school ball held by the student council,

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.060
classes that start this afternoon have been canceled.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.610
There is also an announcement to the people attending the ball:

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:29.570
The waiting room for the participants will be opened at 2:00 P.M.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.450
Those who are going, please come to the student council room.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:32.620
"Ball", huh?
Those who are going, please come to the student council room.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:32.950
Those who are going, please come to the student council room.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:33.370
This year will also be extravagant, don't you think?
Those who are going, please come to the student council room.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:34.580
This year will also be extravagant, don't you think?

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.040
The student council is always doing things thoroughly.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.710
Aren't you two attending it?

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.500
I'm not going to attend it.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.840
I'm also not going to attend it.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.710
Are you attending it, Kitagawa-kun?

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.420
Um, I was thinking if I should attend it, so...

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.430
Misaka, let's attend it together.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.760
Why do I have to go with you?

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:54.810
Eh, um, eh...

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.640
But, having the afternoon off is good, right?

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:00.690
Nayuki, why don't we stop by somewhere?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.650
Yeah!

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:02.650
How about you, Yuuichi?

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.070
Yuuichi?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.790
Hey, I'm getting nervous.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.000
Me too.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.340
Does a tuxedo suit me?

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.840
It's alright, Yuuichi-san.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:30.720
Really?

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:34.800
Hey look, Mai, this suits Yuuichi-san right?

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:41.480
What is it? Speak clearly if you have something to say!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:45.560
I won't know unless I see you wearing it.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.480
Okay, Mai!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.700
I am going to show you I will look perfect in it!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.740
Let's look forward to it, Mai.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.580
I'm going to escort Mai first!

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.620
You're going to dance with me first!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:06.040
We must show everyone that you really are feminine.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.550
These, I thought these would look good on you, Mai.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.380
Put them on.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:15.470
Come on.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.940
They match you well, Mai.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.690
I can't do it, after all.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:33.990
Mai!

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:36.910
Sayuri.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.950
Mai, you always decide everything by yourself.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:47.210
It's not good... Trying to solve things by yourself like that.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:48.790
But...

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.010
No buts...

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.720
It's going to start.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.260
Yuuichi-san's waiting.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.720
Let's go, Mai.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:04.560
Yeah...

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.820
<b>Ball</b>

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.660
The ball... that I admire...

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.790
Then, Yuuichi stepped on Keroppi...

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.540
What's wrong?

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.410
Nothing.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.540
Let's go.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:40.930
Would you dance with me?

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.230
This is not... a place for me.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.350
Sorry.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.110
What's wrong? Don't you have an escort?

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.190
You're my escort.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.360
Me!?

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.110
Are you by chance Sayuri-san?

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:01.910
It's a joke.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.080
I almost didn't recognize it was you, Mai.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.290
You look like a young noble lady from somewhere.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.000
Young noble lady...

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.460
Yeah, Mai.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:11.790
A young noble lady!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.500
You look good too, Yuuichi.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.420
Since I saw you wearing it.

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:17.760
I see.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.220
And where's Sayuri-san?

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.600
She said that she had to go greet her acquaintance.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.970
Mai, how about you?

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:28.310
It's a rare chance, isn't there someone special you'd like to appeal to rather than be with me.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:31.610
Mai?

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.610
You promised.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.440
That we're going to dance first.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.110
I see.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.200
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.360
Then let's dance.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:41.660
Yuuichi, can you dance?

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:42.870
It's alright.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.120
If we're having fun, then...

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.410
Yeah.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.000
I can't fully understand it.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:52.420
About why you refused the student council.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.090
If you joined the student council...

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.260
I'm not refusing.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:02.220
But, right now, I have something more important than that.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:04.550
An important thing?

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:05.930
What could that be?

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.020
Mai! Yuuichi-san!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.940
I can't watch.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.030
It's like they don't have any manners.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.320
It's alright, right...

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.280
It's not about manners...

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:36.960
Thanks.

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:39.970
Mai, do you want something to drink?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:43.840
Here!

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:54.060
You must be kidding!

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.150
Sayuri!

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:57.650
Mai!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.610
Don't draw your sword out in a place like this!

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.090
Damn it! Why here!?

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:20.710
Kurata-san!

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:21.760
Sayuri-san!

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:22.720
Sayuri!

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.180
Sayuri-san!

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:35.900
Sayuri-san!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.360
I thought these would look good on you, Mai.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:46.450
Sayuri-san!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.530
Sayuri-san!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.410
Yuuichi-san...

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.750
Mai! Sayuri-san is alright!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:55.540
Mai.

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:56.750
Mai!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:00.800
Damn it!

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.270
Mai!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:19.860
Stop!

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.020
Stop it!

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.110
Mai!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.200
Who is it!?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.160
Why!?

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.620
Kawasumi, is that you again!?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:31.990
Why did it turn out like this!?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:32.490
Stop that!
Why did it turn out like this!?

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:32.830
Stop that!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:39.000
You ruined the dress Sayuri-san arranged with so much effort...!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:43.300
Mai!

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.920
You don't have any intention of making an excuse?

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.340
This time, it's different from the past.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:10:01.890
I was also there, and there are eyewitness testimonies that said you were swinging a sword.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.930
In reality, it appears that there are injured people.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.720
Geez, I'm disgusted by you.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:12.520
What was your intention for breaking the glass and ruining the ball?

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.900
Hey, Kawasumi, why don't you say something?

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.820
She just listens quietly...

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:19.820
...and then Mai gets suspended.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.150
Is that how it is?

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:22.450
Then, sensei...

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:23.990
Yeah...

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:25.620
Is it okay, Kawasumi?

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.870
You are going to get expelled!

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.160
Expelled!?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:34.460
Mai!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.540
Eavesdropping is rude.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.340
Mai!

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.550
It seems Kurata-san was accompanying you as well.

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.010
Please listen.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:48.640
This is our observation of what Mai did at the ball.

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:51.890
Kawasumi-san's punishment won't be changed.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:54.850
You won't even listen to what we have to say!?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.320
What story do I need to listen to?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.530
The reason she broke the windows?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.110
Or is it the reason why she ruined the ball?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.240
Kuze-san!

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.370
I don't care about the reason!

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.490
The results of her actions are everything.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:12.830
I don't get it. Why you need to defend this student!?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.790
What do you mean "this student"!?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.340
Hey, stop it!

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.840
Whose benefit is the student council for!?

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.680
It's the student council for the benefit of sound students.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.470
You're saying that Mai is not!?

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:28.930
Her bad behavior is infamous among the student council.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.970
Her actions are famous, it isn't just this one event.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:35.060
Why won't you understand that there is a reason behind it!?

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.060
Yuuichi-san!

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:38.820
If it's for Mai, then please stop.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.740
If you had hit me, you would be expelled along with Kawasumi-san.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:48.450
Mai!

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.120
Mai is my best friend.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.710
Yuuichi-san, take care of Mai.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:57.920
I got it!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.380
The reason why doesn't matter.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.510
I like Mai,

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.800
and Mai is my close important friend, so...

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.760
So I want to do something for her.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.390
Am I wrong?

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.230
Mai!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.190
Are you leaving?

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.270
I'm not a student here anymore.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.730
Do you have some time?

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.240
Just a bit.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.070
I didn't know you that well in the beginning.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.370
About why Sayuri-san was with you.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.790
You have an unsociable attitude, and why the student council keeps an eye on you...

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.500
But Sayuri-san said it.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.290
That you are a good person.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.210
I see.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.050
Yuuichi?

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:47.840
What's wrong, Minase?

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.090
Sorry.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.430
Nothing.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.430
What was that all about, Nayuki?

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:58.770
But, I kinda get what Sayuri-san was saying.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.610
Letting the wild dog eat that bento,
(T/L Note: Boxed Lunch)

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.730
and quietly accepting the false charges...

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:05.740
You're really a good person...!

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:10.410
So she wanted everyone to understand your virtues.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.030
Was it an unnecessary meddling?

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.910
Were the things that Sayuri-san and I were doing for you all unnecessary!?

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:22.420
Can you just sit there, ignore us and leave after what we have done?

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:27.010
Did you hear what Sayuri-san said a while ago?

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.930
She said that you're her best friend.

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:31.260
And she said you were a very important friend.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:32.720
Can you ignore that too!?

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.560
That's pitiful for Sayuri-san!

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:38.690
Sorry for keeping you.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.230
It's over, just go.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.020
Yuuichi.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.570
I don't know what I should do.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.530
Yuuichi, what should I do?

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.370
Just say what exactly you're feeling right now.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.370
I think that Sayuri is my best friend.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.210
I'm thinking she's very important.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:06.340
I'm sorry, I want to be with Yuuichi and Sayuri.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.260
To tell the truth, I want it to be the three of us.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.970
I got it, I'll do something about it.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.560
I'll make it so you can be with us again for sure!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:25.770
I said that I'll do something, but what should I do?

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:30.820
Yuuichi-san!

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.280
Sayuri-san?

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.740
Are you shopping for something?

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.120
Never mind that, where's Mai?

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.450
Mai is alright.

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:42.670
Kuze-san is very understanding if you tell him everything.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:43.880
Him!?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.090
Anyway, I have something to ask you.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.210
Something to ask me?

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:50.470
Tomorrow is Mai's birthday.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:54.680
I was wondering if Yuuichi-san can pick out a present for her with me.

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:05.560
Last year, I gave her Pig-san as a present.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.320
"Pig-san!?"

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:11.780
It was a cute music box with many pigs as angels flying.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.070
Was that cute?

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.780
Mai was very happy with it.

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:18.200
Saying "Thank you".

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.410
Well at least she would say thanks.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.080
It was Mai's complete sincerity.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.210
That was her best.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.170
I see.

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:33.420
Then let's give her what we want to give her.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.760
Yes! That's the best, right?

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:38.930
Let's make it something that's very girlish!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:39.930
Yes!

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.520
How about that?

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:45.900
What is this!?

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.520
Mai will definitely be happy!

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.480
Okay everyone, I'll introduce her.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:52.820
What is that?

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:55.450
Don't tell me...!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.660
Hey! Yuuichi!

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:03.450
This is Kurata Sayuri-san, who will be joining the student council.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.580
She will be graduating soon and it seems her intentions are the same as ours.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.630
Sayuri-san... why?
She will be graduating soon and it seems her intentions are the same as ours.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.420
She will be graduating soon and it seems her intentions are the same as ours.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.960
Is it for Mai?

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.680
Yuuichi-san!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.720
Sayuri-san, I have something to talk to you about.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.760
This is perfect timing,

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.770
I also have something to talk to Yuuichi-san about.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.140
It's about Mai's present.

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.770
Is it for Mai?

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.190
Of course!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.190
Not about the present!

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:36.900
I'm asking why Sayuri-san is with the guys on the student council?

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.410
It's just until graduation.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.490
I'm okay with it.

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:42.790
Sayuri-san!

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.700
Anyway, Yuuichi-san...

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:49.130
We will have a regular birthday party Sunday, but...

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.090
...I think that we should give her the present today.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:55.670
Let's all meet at the same time and surprise her!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.720
Sayuri-san!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.720
I think I'll be late, so...

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.720
Please tell me your phone number, Yuuichi-san.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.390
I got it.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:12.570
I have a meeting right now,

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.730
so see you later, Yuuichi-san!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.830
Sayuri-san did it for Mai...

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.950
After all, I can't do... anything at all...!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.040
Yuuichi-kun!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.830
Yuuichi-kun!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.790
Yuuichi-kun!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.800
Yuuichi-kun!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.260
Hello, Yuuichi-kun.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.300
It's not "Hello"!

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.140
Are you doing the "eat-and-run" again!?

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:44.220
No, I'm not!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.600
I was calling you but Yuuichi-kun was ignoring me.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:49.350
Even so, stop bumping into me.

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.560
Don't you know any other greetings?

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:53.940
I said "Hello".

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.900
So, did you want me for something?

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:00.360
I just called you since you were there, Yuuichi-kun.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.280
Don't call me if you don't have anything to say!

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:03.950
Ughuu, you're mean.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.370
What are you doing?

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.660
I'm trying to find my lost thing.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.500
You still can't find it?

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.000
Yeah, still.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:14.630
But I need to find it.

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.630
Do you know what you're looking for?

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.170
I don't know.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:23.590
But Yuuichi-kun said "Why don't you go to the places that you frequent?".

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:27.890
Yeah, I said that, but you couldn't find it in the end.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.850
But all I can do right now is just look.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.060
I see.

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:35.230
Yeah!

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.730
What's the matter, Yuuichi-kun?

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.990
Nothing. Try your best, Ayu.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.570
Yeah! I'll try my best!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.410
Thanks, Yuuichi-kun!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.410
See you, Ayu.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.410
Yeah!

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.120
There is something I can do...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.290
Yeah, I need to do what I can do right now...

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.300
Sayuri-san is also doing all she can!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:07.760
Yuuichi-san.

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:08.930
Welcome home.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:13.230
A while ago, there was a call from a girl named "Kurata-san".

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:15.230
Oh no.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.770
I didn't hear where to contact her.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.360
It's alright.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:21.530
She said "Let's wait at the gate".

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.950
Is that the school gate?

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:25.450
Yes.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:40.960
She's not here.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.170
Is she in the classroom?

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.730
Yuuichi.

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:54.770
Oh! Mai!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:55.940
About Sayuri-san...

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.320
Nah, Nevermind.

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.400
I was able to come back to school.

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:07.950
They told me that I can come back to school.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.080
Really?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:10.870
Yeah.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.660
I see, that's great!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.120
Thanks.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.370
What?

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.670
I heard it from Sayuri.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:20.380
That Yuuichi and Sayuri have done many things for me.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.170
Nope, I didn't do anything.

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.050
Sayuri-san did her best.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.800
Sayuri has always defended me.

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.300
When the glass first broke, she said...

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:34.270
"Mai is my best friend, so there must be a reason"....

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:35.680
I knew it...

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.730
Sayuri-san joined to let Mai return to school...

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:41.440
You have to make it worth while.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.400
Both of your feelings.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:47.150
The feelings of Mai, and also the feelings of Sayuri-san too.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:49.030
Yeah.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.660
Oh yeah, Mai.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:55.290
Is it... that monster!?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:06.340
It's strange.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:07.510
It's not coming this way.

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:08.880
That way.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.140
What on earth is it?

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:13.560
About the monsters.

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:16.680
What's wrong?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:17.690
A stuffed animal.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:51.510
It can't... why...?

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:06.230
Sayu... ri...

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:30.250
In between the flowing clouds
nagareru kunono aimani

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:35.990
The crawling blue sky
muzuita aozora ga

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:41.670
Even causes the familiar town
minareta machinami de sae

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:47.140
To light up
kagayakasete kureru

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.980
Running small back
kaketeku chiisana senaka

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:58.870
The two at that time were...
anokoro no futariga

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:04.290
The reason for the spilling pain
koboreru itami no wakewo

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:10.030
Hidden with innocence
mujyakisa de kakushita

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:18.400
Time is flowing quietly
tokiwa shizukani nagare

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:24.030
The gentle winds blow
yasashii kaze ga fuita

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:29.660
Numbed feelings too will
Kajikanda omoimo

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:35.910
Change to a smile
egao ni kawarukara

